        "cellar_door_faq_1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What are your opening hours?",
            "answer": "<p>Our Cellar Door at Healesville is open 10.00am to 5.00pm, Thursday to Monday.</p><p><strong>Wine Tastings:</strong> Thurs – Mon, 10am – 4pm</p><p><strong>Kitchen:</strong> Mon/Thurs/Fri, 12pm – 3pm, Sat/Sun, 11am – 4pm</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "cellar_door_faq_2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I need to book?",
            "answer": "<p>To ensure we can dedicate time with you and your group, we recommended that you make a booking for all wine tastings and lunch sittings. Visit our <a href=\"/pages/book-now\">booking page</a> for more info.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "cellar_door_faq_3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you do wine tastings?",
            "answer": "<p>Wine tastings are $15pp, refundable upon purchase of 2+ bottles, and includes five wines from our Tasting Menu.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "cellar_door_faq_4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What can we eat?",
            "answer": "<p>We offer locally sourced charcuterie and cheese paddles, as well as our traditional thin base pizzas. We have vegetarian, vegan and gluten free options, and can accommodate most dietary requirements. Please note this at your time of booking.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "cellar_door_faq_5": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I bring my dog?",
            "answer": "<p>We love our four-legged friends and we are pleased to be a dog-friendly venue in outdoor areas only. Dogs must remain on lead and under supervision at all times. Please note this alongside your booking.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "cellar_door_faq_6": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What about large groups?",
            "answer": "<p><strong>Wine Tastings</strong> – Please call or email us for bookings of 11+ people (you will not be able to make a booking via the booking system for groups larger than 11).</p><p><strong>Restaurant</strong> – Groups of 10+ will enjoy the ease of our $55 Feed Me menu, offering a selection of our grazing boards, delicious pizzas and fresh salads ($25 pp for 5–12 years). Please call or email us for bookings of 10+ people (you will not be able to make a booking via the system for groups larger than 10).</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "cellar_door_faq_7": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What seating options do you have?",
            "answer": "<p>We have a number of different seated sections, please view the images on the booking page for more information. We will do our best to seat you in your preferred section, but please make a note of any special requirements upon booking.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "cellar_door_faq_8": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I change or cancel my booking?",
            "answer": "<p>Service is a busy time, and we can't always make it to your phone call. If you need to update, change or cancel your booking, please do this from your booking confirmation email. Otherwise send us an email at <a href=\"mailto:info@boatocraigo.com.au\">info@boatocraigo.com.au</a> and we'll get back to you as soon as we're free.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        }
