    "boc_faq_our_wines": {
      "type": "boc-faq-category",
      "blocks": {
        "our_wines_faq_1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "If I don't know anything about wine, where do I start?",
            "answer": "<p>This is a great question, there is so much to learn about wine, but start with what you enjoy. Make your wine choices fit within your lifestyle, for example, what kinds of foods do you enjoy? If it's seafood, try a Sauvignon Blanc or Chardonnay. Love oysters? Try them with a glass of our Sparkling. If you prefer red meats or hearty stews, try our Shiraz or Pinot Noir. It's also a great idea to head to our cellar door and book in a for a tasting, you'll quickly discover what you like. And our cellar door staff are fantastic and helping you through the process.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "our_wines_faq_2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "I love your wine! Do you have a Wine Club where I can get great discounts?",
            "answer": "<p>We do and we'd love you to join the Boato family! Wine Club members enjoy discounts of up to 30% off all wines, including museum releases and reserves, free tastings in cellar door, free shipping on deliveries and exclusive member releases and invites to events. Check out our <a href=\"/pages/wine-club\">Wine Club page</a> for more info.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "our_wines_faq_3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you have any sweet wines at Boat O'Craigo?",
            "answer": "<p>We get asked this one a lot too. At Boato we make predominantly dry wines but have recently experimented with a Sparkling Shiraz and a Field Blend. Browse our <a href=\"/collections/wines\">wines collection</a> for more info.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        }
      },
