            "answer": "<p>Our shipping costs vary depending on the size of your order and where you live. We try to keep our shipping costs as low as we can for you. Best news is that all orders in Victoria, as well as metro Sydney, Brisbane and Adelaide have FREE shipping on all orders of 12+ bottles</p>",
