            "answer": "<p>Our team will pick and dispatch your order as quickly as possible. Once dispatched, you will receive an email notification from AusPost with tracking information to let you know that your order is on its way. At times, Australia Post deem in unsafe to leave deliveries in certain situations. Please check the tracking information to see if your order has been taken to your local post office.</p>",
